      "settings": {
        "full_width": true,
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "Golf Net Frequently Asked questions",
        "content": "<p>The Net Return’s golf practice nets stand out for their durability, portability, and user-friendly design. These nets are perfect for both casual golfers and serious players aiming to fine-tune their game. By investing in a premium-quality golf net for backyard use, you’ll enjoy the flexibility to practice in any weather, on your schedule, and at your own pace.</p><p>Our innovative design ensures durability, safety, and ease of use—they’re the best golf nets for both home and commercial use. Explore The Net Return’s selection today and take the next step toward improving your game.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Pro2_f14bc7d9-d6c1-4ed9-b76e-4f5de7d5df73.jpg",
